'''Zire''' (Sîshëë), also known as ''Nerë'', is an extinct [[Oceanic languages|Oceanic language]] of [[New Caledonia]]. There were 19 speakers in 2009. Zire is sometimes considered a dialect of [[Ajië language|Ajië]].<ref>{{Cite web |date=2010-11-19 |title=Une langue va mourir |url=https://www.lnc.nc/article/societe/une-langue-va-mourir |access-date=2026-04-28 |website=Les Nouvelles Calédoniennes |language=fr-FR}}</ref><ref name=":0">{{Cite web |title=Sîshëë {{!}} Académie des Langues Kanak (ALK) |url=https://www.alk.nc/langues/sishee |access-date=2026-04-28 |website=www.alk.nc}}</ref>

